== fix.sl-gastap.done
- Off means off. No hiss.
== fix.sl-hoodlamp.title
- Replace a fume hood lamp
== fix.sl-hoodlamp.sign
- The light inside the fume hood is out.
== fix.sl-hoodlamp.done
- The hood's lit, end to end.
== fix.sl-balance.title
- Level and zero a lab balance
== fix.sl-balance.sign
- The balance reads a few milligrams with nothing on it.
== fix.sl-balance.done
- Zero, and it stays at zero.

