== fix.w3-cistern.title
- Fix a running cistern
== fix.w3-cistern.sign
- A cistern hisses and runs on long after the flush.
== fix.w3-cistern.done
- Fills, then quiet.
== fix.w3-dryer.title
- Reset a hand dryer
== fix.w3-dryer.sign
- A hand dryer won't start, whatever you wave at it.
== fix.w3-dryer.done
- It roars into life on the first wave.

// ---- Gym (deck 3)
== fix.gy-rower.title
- Fix a squeaking rowing machine
== fix.gy-rower.sign
- The rowing machine squeaks on every pull.
== fix.gy-rower.done
- Smooth, silent strokes.
== fix.gy-bench.title
- Tighten a weight bench
== fix.gy-bench.sign
- A weight bench shifts when someone lies back on it.
== fix.gy-bench.done
- Firm under a full lift.
== fix.gy-tread.title
- Adjust a slipping treadmill belt
== fix.gy-tread.sign
- A treadmill belt slips and lurches mid-stride.
== fix.gy-tread.done
- A steady belt, stride after stride.
== fix.gy-lamp.title
- Replace a gym light
== fix.gy-lamp.sign
- One ceiling light over the mats is out.
== fix.gy-lamp.done
- The whole gym's bright again.
== fix.gy-fountain.title
- Fix the gym water fountain
== fix.gy-fountain.sign
- The water fountain dribbles instead of spouting.
== fix.gy-fountain.done
- A good arc of cold water.

// ---- Crew store (deck 3)
== fix.cs-till.title
- Fix a sticky till drawer
== fix.cs-till.sign
- The till drawer sticks and has to be thumped to open.
== fix.cs-till.done
- It slides open with a ping.
== fix.cs-shelf.title
- Replace a crew store shelf light
== fix.cs-shelf.sign
- A shelf light is out, and the socks are in the dark.
== fix.cs-shelf.done
- Every shelf lit, socks included.
== fix.cs-reader.title
- Fix the crew store's card reader
== fix.cs-reader.sign
- The card reader by the counter keeps saying try again.
== fix.cs-reader.done
- One tap. Paid.

// ---- Call-home booths (deck 3)
== fix.cb-headset.title
- Fix a call-home booth headset
== fix.cb-headset.sign
- A booth headset hisses and drops the sound in one ear.
== fix.cb-headset.done
- Clear sound, both ears. Ready for home.
== fix.cb-door.title
- Reseal a call-home booth door
== fix.cb-door.sign
- Noise from the commons leaks in round a booth door.
== fix.cb-door.done
- Door shut, booth quiet. Private again.
== fix.cb-light.title
- Replace a light by the booths
== fix.cb-light.sign
- The light outside the booths flickers.
== fix.cb-light.done
- A calm, steady light by the booths.

// ---- Cold store (deck 3)
== fix.co-curtain.title
- Rehang the cold store strip curtain
== fix.co-curtain.sign
- Some strips of the cold store curtain have come off their hooks, and cold air spills out.
== fix.co-curtain.done
- Every strip on its hook. The cold stays in.

// ---- Lift lobby (deck 4)
== fix.l4-call.title
- Fix the quarters lift button
== fix.l4-call.sign
- The call button only works if you press it hard, twice.
== fix.l4-call.done
- A light press does it now.
== fix.l4-bench.title
- Steady the bench by the quarters lift
== fix.l4-bench.sign
- The bench by the lift rocks on a loose leg.
== fix.l4-bench.done
- Steady as anything.
== fix.l4-lamp.title
- Replace a downlight by the lift
== fix.l4-lamp.sign
- A downlight by the lift blinks, then sulks.
== fix.l4-lamp.done
- Even light by the lift doors.

// ---- Junior common room (deck 4)
== fix.jc-kettle.title
- Descale the common room kettle
== fix.jc-kettle.sign
- The kettle rumbles for ages, and scale rattles inside it.
== fix.jc-kettle.done
- Boils fast, and the tea tastes of tea.
== fix.jc-sofa.title
- Fix a sagging common room sofa
== fix.jc-sofa.sign
- The end seat of the sofa sinks almost to the floor.
== fix.jc-sofa.done
- Sit anywhere. No sinking.
== fix.jc-lamp.title
- Replace a common room lamp
== fix.jc-lamp.sign
- A floor lamp by the sofa won't switch on.
== fix.jc-lamp.done
- A warm lamp to read by again.
== fix.jc-table.title
- Fix the games table leg
== fix.jc-table.sign
- The games table tips when anyone leans on it, and the pieces slide.
== fix.jc-table.done
- Level table. Pieces stay put.
== fix.jc-screen.title
- Fix the screen's loose lead
== fix.jc-screen.sign
- The common room screen cuts out in the middle of a film.
== fix.jc-screen.done
- Picture all the way to the credits.
== fix.jc-blind.title
- Free a sticky common room blind
== fix.jc-blind.sign
- The window blind is stuck at an angle.
== fix.jc-blind.done
- Straight, and it rolls freely.

// ---- Music room (deck 4)
== fix.mu-stand.title
- Tighten a loose music stand
== fix.mu-stand.sign
- A music stand slowly droops while you're reading from it.
== fix.mu-stand.done
- It holds where you set it.
== fix.mu-player.title
- Fix the record player's tone arm
== fix.mu-player.sign
- The tone arm skips and drags across the record.
== fix.mu-player.done
- It tracks smoothly. The music's back.
== fix.mu-lamp.title
- Replace a music room lamp
== fix.mu-lamp.sign
- The lamp by the record cabinet is out.
== fix.mu-lamp.done
- A soft light over the records.
== fix.mu-amp.title
- Fix a buzzing amp lead
== fix.mu-amp.sign
- The amp buzzes under every note.
== fix.mu-amp.done
- Just the music now.

// ---- Laundry (deck 4)
== fix.la-catch.title
- Fix a sticky dryer door catch
== fix.la-catch.sign
- A dryer door won't catch, so the dryer won't start.
== fix.la-catch.done
- Click, and it starts.
== fix.la-lamp.title
- Replace a laundry room lamp
== fix.la-lamp.sign
- A lamp over the washers is out.
== fix.la-lamp.done
- Bright enough to match your socks.
== fix.la-table.title
- Fix a folding table leg
== fix.la-table.sign
- The folding table sags at one corner.
== fix.la-table.done
- A flat table for folding.
== fix.la-lint.title
- Clear a clogged lint trap
== fix.la-lint.sign
- A dryer runs hot and slow, and fluff pokes out of the trap.
== fix.la-lint.done
- Clean trap. The dryer breathes again.

// ---- Port washroom (deck 4)
== fix.wp-shower.title
- Fix a dripping port shower head
== fix.wp-shower.sign
- A shower head in the port washroom drips long after it's off.
== fix.wp-shower.done
- Off, and dry.
== fix.wp-tap.title
- Fix a loose basin tap
== fix.wp-tap.sign
- A basin tap spins loosely in its mount.
== fix.wp-tap.done
- Firm tap, clean turn.
== fix.wp-rail.title
- Fix a cold towel rail
== fix.wp-rail.sign
- One towel rail is stone cold.
== fix.wp-rail.done
- Warm towels again.

// ---- Starboard washroom (deck 4)
== fix.wq-cold.title
- Fix a shower that runs cold
== fix.wq-cold.sign
- One starboard shower runs warm, then turns cold.
== fix.wq-cold.done
- Warm from start to finish.
== fix.wq-cistern.title
- Fix a running starboard cistern
== fix.wq-cistern.sign
- A starboard cistern keeps trickling into the bowl.
== fix.wq-cistern.done
- It fills, and stops.
== fix.wq-mirror.title
- Replace a mirror light
== fix.wq-mirror.sign
- The light over one mirror is dead.
== fix.wq-mirror.done
- A good light to shave or brush by.

// ---- Works bay (deck 5)
== fix.wb-vice.title
- Fix a vice that won't grip
== fix.wb-vice.sign
- A bench vice slips, however hard it's tightened.
== fix.wb-vice.done
- It bites and holds.
== fix.wb-lamp.title
- Replace a Works bay bench lamp
== fix.wb-lamp.sign
- A bench lamp in the bay flickers over the work.
== fix.wb-lamp.done
- Steady light on the bench.
== fix.wb-rail.title
- Rehang the tool wall rail
== fix.wb-rail.sign
- One rail on the tool wall has dropped at one end.
== fix.wb-rail.done
- Level rail, every tool in its outline.
== fix.wb-stool.title
- Fix a wobbly stool
== fix.wb-stool.sign
- A bay stool rocks on a short leg.
== fix.wb-stool.done
- Four legs down. Sit and work.
== fix.wb-socket.title
- Reset a tripped Works bench socket
== fix.wb-socket.sign
- A bench socket's light is off, and nothing on it works.
== fix.wb-socket.done
- Power back on the bench.

// ---- Works Chief's office (deck 5)
== fix.wo-closer.title
- Adjust the office door closer
== fix.wo-closer.sign
- The Chief's door slams shut with a bang.
== fix.wo-closer.done
- It closes gently, with a soft click.

// ---- Tea corner (deck 5)
== fix.tc-urn.title
- Descale the tea urn
== fix.tc-urn.sign
- The tea urn is slow and furred with scale.
== fix.tc-urn.done
- Hot water, quick. Tea's on.
== fix.tc-table.title
- Fix a wobbly tea table
== fix.tc-table.sign
- The tea table wobbles, and the biscuit tin edges off.
== fix.tc-table.done
- Steady. The biscuits are safe.

// ---- Works washroom (deck 5)
== fix.w5-tap.title
- Fix the Works washroom tap
== fix.w5-tap.sign
- The basin tap drips, and the drip echoes.
== fix.w5-tap.done
- Quiet basin. No echo.
== fix.w5-cistern.title
- Fix the Works washroom cistern
== fix.w5-cistern.sign
- The cistern runs and runs with a thin hiss.
== fix.w5-cistern.done
- Hiss gone. It fills and stops.

// ---- Main storage (deck 5)
== fix.st-ladder.title
- Fix a sticky shelf ladder wheel
== fix.st-ladder.sign
- The shelf ladder drags along its rail with a squeal.
== fix.st-ladder.done
- It rolls along the shelves without a sound.
== fix.st-light.title
- Replace an aisle light
== fix.st-light.sign
- One aisle in storage is dark half the way down.
== fix.st-light.done
- The whole aisle lit. Easy to find things.
== fix.st-scanner.title
- Fix the parts scanner's lead
== fix.st-scanner.sign
- The parts scanner beeps but never reads.
== fix.st-scanner.done
- Beep, read, logged.

// ---- Machine shop (deck 5)
== fix.sh-press.title
- Free a sticking drill press lever
== fix.sh-press.sign
- The drill press lever sticks on the way back up.
== fix.sh-press.done
- It springs back up by itself.
== fix.sh-lamp.title
- Replace the lathe lamp
== fix.sh-lamp.sign
- The lamp over the lathe is out.
== fix.sh-lamp.done
- Clear light over the lathe.
== fix.sh-hose.title
- Fix an extractor hose clamp
== fix.sh-hose.sign
- The extractor hose has slipped off its clamp, and dust drifts out.
== fix.sh-hose.done
- Hose on tight. The dust goes where it should.
== fix.sh-grinder.title
- Fit a new belt on the bench grinder
== fix.sh-grinder.sign
- The bench grinder slows and slips under the lightest touch.
== fix.sh-grinder.done
- Full speed, steady and even.

// ---- Shuttle bay (deck 5)
== fix.sb-floor.title
- Replace a bay floor light
== fix.sb-floor.sign
- One of the guide lights in the bay floor is dark.
== fix.sb-floor.done
- An unbroken line of floor lights.
== fix.sb-ring.title
- Free a stiff tie-down ring
== fix.sb-ring.sign
- A tie-down ring in the deck won't fold flat.
== fix.sb-ring.done
- It folds flush with the deck.
== fix.sb-beacon.title
- Fix a bay warning beacon
== fix.sb-beacon.sign
- The warning beacon by the doors stays dark during its test.
== fix.sb-beacon.done
- It turns and flashes on its test.

// ---- Bay control booth (deck 5)
== fix.bc-screen.title
- Reseat a flickering booth screen
== fix.bc-screen.sign
- A screen in the control booth flickers between two pictures.
== fix.bc-screen.done
- One clear picture. No flicker.

// ---- Lift lobby (deck 5)
== fix.l5-call.title
- Fix the Works deck lift button
== fix.l5-call.sign
- The call button lights, then goes out without calling the lift.
== fix.l5-call.done
- It stays lit until the lift arrives.
== fix.l5-lamp.title
- Replace a Works deck lift downlight
== fix.l5-lamp.sign
- A downlight by the lift buzzes and blinks.
== fix.l5-lamp.done
- No buzz, no blink.

// ---- Lift lobby (deck 6)
== fix.l6-call.title
- Fix the engine deck lift button
== fix.l6-call.sign
- The call button is warm and won't press in.
== fix.l6-call.done
- Cool, and it presses clean.
== fix.l6-bench.title
- Fix the bench by the engine deck lift
== fix.l6-bench.sign
- The bench by the lift squeaks and slides an inch.
== fix.l6-bench.done
- No squeak, no slide.
== fix.l6-lamp.title
- Replace an engine deck lift downlight
== fix.l6-lamp.sign
- The downlight by the lift is dark.
== fix.l6-lamp.done
- Lit, and you can see your feet.

// ---- Engine overlook (deck 6)
== fix.eo-rail.title
- Tighten the overlook hand rail
== fix.eo-rail.sign
- The overlook rail shifts a little under your hand.
== fix.eo-rail.done
- Rock solid. Look down all you like.
== fix.eo-lamp.title
- Replace an overlook lamp
== fix.eo-lamp.sign
- One lamp along the overlook is out.
== fix.eo-lamp.done
- The whole overlook lit, coils and all.

// ---- Engine control (deck 6)
== fix.ec-chair.title
- Fix a stiff control room chair
== fix.ec-chair.sign
- A control room chair won't roll or turn without a shove.
== fix.ec-chair.done
- It rolls and turns at a touch.

// ---- Engine watch room (deck 6)
== fix.ew-lamp.title
- Replace the engine watch desk lamp
== fix.ew-lamp.sign
- The desk lamp in the watch room flickers over the logbook.
== fix.ew-lamp.done
- Steady light on the logbook.
== fix.ew-jack.title
- Fix a loose headset jack
== fix.ew-jack.sign
- The headset drops out whenever its plug is nudged.
== fix.ew-jack.done
- Plug in, stay in.

// ---- Concourse (deck 7)
== fix.rc-lamp.title
- Replace a concourse lamp
== fix.rc-lamp.sign
- A concourse lamp flickers over the benches.
== fix.rc-lamp.done
- Steady light along the concourse.

// ---- Lift lobby (deck 7)
== fix.rc-call.title
- Fix the rec deck lift button
== fix.rc-call.sign
- The call button clicks but the lift never comes.
== fix.rc-call.done
- Click, and the lift's on its way.

// ---- Auditorium (deck 7)
== fix.au-stool.title
- Fix a wobbly stage stool
== fix.au-stool.sign
- The stool on the stage wobbles under anyone who sits.
== fix.au-stool.done
- Steady enough for a solo.
== fix.au-lectern.title
- Fix the lectern's reading light
== fix.au-lectern.sign
- The lectern's little light is out.
== fix.au-lectern.done
- A neat pool of light on the notes.
== fix.au-board.title
- Tighten a loose stage board
== fix.au-board.sign
- One stage board creaks and lifts at the edge.
== fix.au-board.done
- Flat and silent underfoot.

// ---- Pool (deck 7)
== fix.po-lounger.title
- Fix a stiff lounger hinge
== fix.po-lounger.sign
- A poolside lounger's back won't lie down.
== fix.po-lounger.done
- It reclines all the way. Lovely.
== fix.po-lamp.title
- Replace a poolside lamp
== fix.po-lamp.sign
- A lamp by the pool is out, and its reflection is missing.
== fix.po-lamp.done
- Every lamp, and its reflection, back.

// ---- River hall (deck 7)
== fix.rv-shower.title
- Fix the beach shower tap
== fix.rv-shower.sign
- The beach shower tap won't turn off properly and drizzles.
== fix.rv-shower.done
- Off, and the sand stays dry.
== fix.rv-cleat.title
- Tighten a loose kayak cleat
== fix.rv-cleat.sign
- A kayak cleat on the jetty wobbles when a rope's pulled.
== fix.rv-cleat.done
- Firm cleat. The kayak's going nowhere.

// ---- Changing rooms (deck 7)
== fix.ch-locker.title
- Free a jammed locker
== fix.ch-locker.sign
- A locker door is stuck shut, and its catch won't turn.
== fix.ch-locker.done
- It opens with a click.
== fix.ch-shower.title
- Fix a dripping changing room shower
== fix.ch-shower.sign
- A changing room shower drips on the tiles all night.
== fix.ch-shower.done
- Dry tiles by morning.
== fix.ch-lamp.title
- Replace a changing room light
== fix.ch-lamp.sign
- One light in the changing rooms flickers.
== fix.ch-lamp.done
- Steady light by the lockers.
